OL,3,AClean-up under way as Storm Boelo
OL,4,Aleaves 90,000 without power
OL,5,
OL,6,FA clean-up operation is under way in
OL,7,Fparts of the UK after Storm Boelo
OL,8,Fcaused caused flooding and property
OL,9,Fdamage, leaving thousands without
OL,10,Fpower.
OL,12,FThe Energy Networks Association (ENA)
OL,13,Fsaid around 90,000 properties are still
OL,14,Fwithout power as of Monday.
OL,16,FTwo men were killed by falling trees
OL,17,Fduring the storm on Sunday - a man in
OL,18,Fhis 20s in north London and a
OL,19,F60-year-old in Dumfries and Galloway.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
