OL,3,ACelebrations in Serbia after veteran
OL,4,Aruler VuDMiDG loses election to
OL,5,Astudent-led protest movement
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It is clear we have lost these
OL,8,Felections," right-wing populist leader
OL,9,FVuDMiDG said as he conceded late on
OL,10,FSunday, citing preliminary figures that
OL,11,Fgave the students 2.2 million votes and
OL,12,Fhis party 1.72 million.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
